{
  "uid": "lgtm-traces",
  "title": "LGTM - Traces Detective",
  "description": "Find a slow or failed run, open its trace (HTTP -> compile -> execute -> ipfs.upload), then jump to the logs of that same trace.",
  "tags": ["ft_lgtm"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "status",
        "label": "Run status",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "success,compile_error,runtime_error,timeout,internal_error",
        "current": { "text": "timeout", "value": "timeout" },
        "options": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to use this dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "1. **Metric -> Trace**: on *Metrics Big Picture*, click an exemplar dot on the latency panel.\n2. **Trace**: the spans below are `POST /api/run` -> `compile` -> `execute` -> `ipfs.upload`. The slow stage is the widest bar.\n3. **Trace -> Log**: inside a span, use **Logs for this span** to see the Loki lines carrying the same `trace_id`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Recent runs with status $status",
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"lgtm-backend\" && span.playground.status=\"$status\"}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Stage duration p95 (from span metrics)",
      "description": "Served by Tempo's metrics-generator, written into Mimir.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, span_name) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket{service=\"lgtm-backend\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{span_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Backend logs (Loki)",
      "description": "Each line carries trace_id as structured metadata; the TraceID link opens Tempo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "{service_name=\"lgtm-backend\"}",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
